The code also includes robust error handling for pigpio initialization, SPI transmission failures, and file I/O errors. If any of these errors occur, the code exits with an error message.

Finally, the code ensures clean resource release of SPI handles, files, and pigpio on all exit paths, including graceful shutdown via SIGINT and SIGTERM.

