This code initializes the pigpio library, SPI device, and ADC device, and sets up the signal handlers for SIGINT and SIGTERM. It then enters an infinite loop where it reads the ADC value, maps it to a PWM duty cycle, and sets the motors accordingly. If the ADC read fails, it logs the error and skips the iteration. If the noise level exceeds the threshold, it logs the event to a file. Finally, it closes the SPI and ADC devices and terminates the pigpio library on exit.

