This code initializes the pigpio library, opens the I2C bus, sets the I2C slave address, checks the model ID, performs a software reset, configures the timing budget, opens a message queue, opens a GPIO for the buzzer, starts ranging, and polls the data-ready bit every 50 ms. If the measured distance falls below 100mm, the buzzer is activated. The code logs distance readings to the message queue and cleans up resources on exit.

