This code initializes pigpio, opens the I2C bus, sends the continuous measurement command, waits for conversion, reads 9 bytes containing pressure, temperature, and scale factors, validates the CRC-8 on each 3-byte data word, converts the raw values using the per-reading scale factors, and logs the results to stdout. It also handles CRC mismatches and sensor-absent or bus-error paths by closing the I2C handle and terminating pigpio. Finally, it handles SIGINT and SIGTERM for graceful shutdown by closing the I2C handle and calling gpioTerminate() on all exit paths.

