This code uses the `libgpiod` C API to control the LED, and the `i2c-dev` interface to read the temperature from the STTS2004 sensor. It checks every I2C read and every libgpiod GPIO operation, and handles errors by logging the `errno` details and exiting cleanly. It also handles SIGINT/SIGTERM by releasing all libgpiod resources (lines and chips), closing the I2C file descriptor, and turning the LED off before exiting.

